- [NEW] DIVERGENCE: dashboard's known-good modern redirect (`https://me.sumup.com/api/sso/callback`, valid on auth.sumup.com/oauth2/auth) is REJECTED on the legacy path → legacy path resolves an older, distinct client profile. No redirect candidate accepted (hosts, `sumup://` schemes, localhost, `urn:oob`, docs samples) → legacy allowlist strict.
- [NEW] `developer.sumup.com` fully exportable (`llms-full.txt`, 566KB): OAuth docs — endpoints `api.sumup.com/{authorize,token}`, third-party `client_id` 27-char + 64-hex secret, full scope model + registration flow at `me.sumup.com/settings/oauth2-applications`; docs-sample client_id → `invalid_client` (registry randomized).
